<p> (Numbers in 1,000s): Feb	Jan---(Prev)	Dec--(Prev)</p>
<p> Workforce	  135,634  135,848  135,848  135,022  135,022</p>
<p> -Employed	  128,430  128,580  128,580  127,855  127,855</p>
<p> -Unemployed	  7,205    7,268    7,268    7,167    7,167</p>
